Tournament story
I did a speed test on the ultra fast car and it scored 1.34 (very good btw, record for speed at that point was 1.25) but it shattered down the middle :( making it completely unusable. So all my hope rested on the micro mobile......

Tournament setup: IF YOU LOSE ONCE YOU'RE OUT :(
DETAIL: MY CAR BROKE AFTER EVERY RUN 😭

Race 1: Me vs another aerodynamic car. It was too close to tell and the slow-mo at the end was not live, so we did not know who won. Victory was awarded to him.... BUT OVERTURNED FOR A REMATCH.

Race 2: (race 1 rematch) My car was shattered after that but using my FRC pit skills I REBUILT. After heavy use of hot glue, we got ready. I WON BY .2 sec with a time of 1.4. But that's not fast enough... so I started shaving the car down as much as possible and making it more aerodynamic.

Race 3: We got a match against a guy named Alex and I saw his insane car. I had made a design tweak to have the front wheels raised and holding the fishing line tighter, therefore reducing friction. The race sets off and I WON with a .155 sec advantage. Grand time 1.305, not bad but I must get better. Unfortunately I had a front hairline crack. My front axles were blown out and I had a right side shatter point. SO BACK TO FIXING.

Race 4: I made a new method of rebuilding my front axles with a basic rig. I created a wooden base with a good cut and a drill first, then glued after putting the axle through. I set it up and won with a time of 1.286. SO CLOSE TO THE RECORD. Problem: THE CO2 CARTRIDGE MADE A HOLE THROUGH THE FRONT OF THE CAR. AXLE HOLES ARE BROKEN. AXLE IS BENT. WHEELS ARE SHATTERED. Welp, this is going to be one fun pit stop. (I have 10 mins btw ╥﹏╥)

Race 5: SEMI FINALS (I'M COOKED ╥﹏╥) The car somehow got fixed in time. Let's do this. WIN WITH A 1.29. (I make adjustments to the car for optimization after every race).

THE FINALE - RAHHHHHHHHHHH
The final: me vs the car with the record. I will not describe..... just watch the finale video and know.... I WON WITH A NEW TIME RECORD!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

